{'symbol': 'ZBRA', 'date': '2022-11-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES APPOINTS TAMI FROESE AS CHIEF SUPPLY CHAIN OFFICER', 'text': 'LINCOLNSHIRE, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NASDAQ: ZBRA), AN INNOVATOR AT THE FRONT LINE OF BUSINESS WITH SOLUTIONS AND PARTNERS THAT DELIVER A PERFORMANCE EDGE, ANNOUNCED THAT TAMI FROESE HAS BEEN NAMED CHIEF SUPPLY CHAIN OFFICER.'}